## What Each Improvement Addresses:

| Improvement | Security Threat Addressed | OWASP Category |
|------------|--------------------------|----------------|
| Helmet.js | XSS, Clickjacking, MIME sniffing | A5, A7 |
| Rate Limiting | DoS, Brute Force | A2 |
| Input Validation | Injection attacks | A1 |
